{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓劇《請回答1988》的男星高庚杓昨日驚爆涉酒駕，形象受挫，原定本月21日舉行的兩場見面會宣布取消，他參演的4個綜藝節目先後宣布刪剪其鏡頭，他跟朴寶劍合作的新節目也恐受影響。</p><p>他就涉酒駕一事道歉：「我曾呼籲大家不要酒駕，卻違背自己說過的話。</p><p>我</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:12:03.236188+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T03:54:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T04:05:24.990611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:05:24.990611+00:00","content_hash":"a878ca776250197767a3c98f93d917b3af01147a1e3ce40db21add9bdbcb7d0a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}